@base = http://localhost:7071
@token = local-user
@jobId = JOB_ID
@runId = RUN_ID

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Unauthenticated feed → 401
GET {{base}}/api/v1/jobs

### Unified job feed (deduped, paginated)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/jobs?sources=greenhouse,lever&limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search and location filters
GET {{base}}/api/v1/jobs?q=engineer&location=Remote&status=all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Job detail (includes description + sources)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Per-source sync status
GET {{base}}/api/v1/sources/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a Greenhouse board token (201; flips configured)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sources/greenhouse/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boardToken": "acme"
}

### Add a Greenhouse board URL
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sources/greenhouse/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boardUrl": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/acme"
}

### Add a Lever company URL
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sources/lever/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyUrl": "https://jobs.lever.co/acme"
}

### List Greenhouse tenants
GET {{base}}/api/v1/sources/greenhouse/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove a Greenhouse board (last tenant returns unconfigured)
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/sources/greenhouse/tenants/no-such-board
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove a Lever board
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/sources/lever/tenants/acme
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recrawl one Greenhouse board (202)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sources/greenhouse/tenants/no-such-board/crawl
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start a Greenhouse crawl (202)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sources/greenhouse/crawl
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start a Lever crawl (202)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sources/lever/crawl
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crawl run status
GET {{base}}/api/v1/sources/greenhouse/runs/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
